  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/1e1ca96e4502bf596e5d5df6c6e80bda48f5a469ca70c7b53e1bc830f3d90d48.png] \n\nGiven: 148 I 104 L 126 I (76 K 2) I (11 J 3) L 55 = ?\n\nDecoding the letters:\n\n \n \n\n Letters\n K\n J\n I\n L\n \n \n\n coded as\n ÷ \n × \n +\n -\n \n \n\n148 I 104 L 126 I (76 K 2) I (11 J 3) L 55 = ? ⇒ 148 + 104 - 126 + (76 ÷ 2) + (11 × 3) - 55 = ?\n\n⇒ 148 + 104 - 126 -__** (76 ÷ 2)**__ +__** (11 × 3) **__- 55 = ?\n\n⇒ __**148 + 104**__ - 126__** + 38 + 33**__ - 55 = ?\n\n⇒ 323__** - 126 - 55**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 323 - 181 = 142.\n\nHence, the correct answer is** \"Option 2\".**",
